                                "example_id": "af2b819d-f046-46ec-9ea4-b194976631b0",
                                "sense_id": "7ed6713e-5b15-3229-89b3-b7d4fec20a15",
                                "text": "The illness. It came out of nowhere. His breathing all of a sudden started hurting the back of his throat. Then that overfull heat in various cranial meatus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b190faa7-ebe1-4c25-a1d1-b6dee5070bdb",
                                "sense_id": "7ed6713e-5b15-3229-89b3-b7d4fec20a15",
                                "text": "The vibrissae are coarse hairs whose follicles are located just within the nasal meatus."
